                    <div class="insight-label"><span>Restés éveillés<small>Pendant la même période de repos</small></span><strong>30<span>%</span></strong></div>
                    <div class="eeg-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="eeg-bar eeg-bar--reference" style="width:30%"></span></div>
                  </div>
